---

<section class="w-full py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none"
    style="background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='52' height='26' viewBox='0 0 52 26' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.4'%3E%3Cpath d='M10 10c0-2.21-1.79-4-4-4-3.314 0-6-2.686-6-6h2c0 2.21 1.79 4 4 4 3.314 0 6 2.686 6 6 0 2.21 1.79 4 4 4 3.314 0 6 2.686 6 6 0 2.21 1.79 4 4 4v2c-3.314 0-6-2.686-6-6 0-2.21-1.79-4-4-4-3.314 0-6-2.686-6-6zm25.464-1.95l8.486 8.486-1.414 1.414-8.486-8.486 1.414-1.414z' /%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;);"
  ></div>

  <div class="container relative">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-10 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="flex-1 text-center lg:text-left space-y-6 sm:space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">
            <span class="block">LET'S GO</span>
            <span class="block text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl mt-2">
              <span class="text-yellow-300">SAAT</span><span class="text-white">NYA</span>
            </span>
            <span class="block mt-2">KAMU JOIN!</span>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
          Jadilah bagian dari komunitas developer terbesar di Indonesia.
          Tingkatkan skill, perluas jaringan, dan raih kesempatan karir
          bersama kami!
        </p>

        <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-start">
          <a
            href="#community"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 px-6 sm:px-8 py-3.5 sm:py-4 bg-yellow-300 hover:bg-yellow-400 text-gray-900 rounded-full text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold transition-all hover:gap-5 shadow-lg group"
          >
            <span>Join Sekarang</span>
            <svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="w-5 h-5 transition-all group-hover:rotate-45"><path d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full flex-1 max-w-sm sm:max-w-md lg:max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mr-0">
        <div class="relative p-4 sm:p-8">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/10 rounded-3xl transform rotate-3 sm:rotate-6"></div>
          <div class="relative bg-white/10 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-lg border border-white/20 shadow-xl">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:gap-6 text-white">
              <img src="/logo.webp" alt="IMPHNEN" class="w-[180px] sm:w-[240px] h-auto object-contain" />
              <div class="text-center space-y-1 sm:space-y-2">
                <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold">250.000+</h3>
                <p class="text-sm sm:text-lg text-white/90">Programmer Sudah Bergabung</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
